	<string>Barterly uses the camera only when you tap to take a photo or video of your work for an application or deliverable.</string>
	<key>NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
	<string>When you open your check-in pass, Barterly shares how far you are from the property with your host. It never stops you checking in.</string>
	<key>NSMicrophoneUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Barterly records sound with intro videos you add to applications.</string>
